WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
I skipped three workouts this week.
My plan already fixed itself.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.300
I tell it what's actually happening,
and it moves everything else around me.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.470
It's not an app. It's texting someone
who actually knows me.
